Rule 2 (tensor 'a' and 'b' must have equal length.)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= shape(a) = shape(b)
>>
Rule 3 (tensor 'a' must have at least a one-dimensional)
{a: tensor} |= ndim(a) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (tensor 'b' must have at least a one-dimensional)
{b: tensor} |= ndim(b) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (tensor 'a' dimension size at axis zero must be greater than zero)
{a: tensor} |= shape(a, 0) > 0
>>
Rule 6 (tensor 'b' dimension size at axis zero must be greater than zero)
{b: tensor} |= shape(b, 0) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (ndim of input tensors must be positive numbers)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= ndim(a) > 0 ∧ ndim(b) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (shape of input tensors must be greater than zero)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= shape(a) > 0 ∧ shape(b) > 0
>>
Rule 14 (sum of all shape dimensions should be greater than zero)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 15 (Shape of tensor 'a' must be a positive number)
{a: tensor} |= shape(a) > 0
>>
Rule 16 (Shape of tensor 'b' must be a positive number)
{b: tensor} |= shape(b) > 0
>>
Rule 21 (the shape of tensor 'a' must be greater or equal to 1)
{a: tensor} |= shape(a) >= 1
>>
Rule 22 (the shape of tensor 'b' must be greater or equal to 1)
{b: tensor} |= shape(b) >= 1
>>
Rule 30 (If a is a 1D tensor, b can be any dimension length)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= ndim(a) = 1 ∨ ndim(b) = 1 ∨ ndim(a) > 1 ∧ ndim(b) > 1
>>
Rule 38 (The dimensions of a and b must be compatible for outer product)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= ndim(a) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(b) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 40 (If a is a 1D tensor, b must be a 1D tensor)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= ndim(a) = 1 ∧ ndim(b) = 1
>>
Rule 41 (If a is a 2D tensor, b must be a 2D tensor)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= ndim(a) = 2 ∧ ndim(b) = 2
>>
Rule 42 (If a is a 3D tensor, b must be a 2D tensor)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= ndim(a) = 3 ∧ ndim(b) = 2
>>
Rule 43 (If a is a 2D tensor, the shape of b along the second dimension must be equal to the shape of a along the first dimension)
{a: tensor, b: tensor} |= ndim(a) = 2 ∧ ndim(b) = 2 ∧ shape(a, 0) = shape(b, 1)
